# Cursor Rules — Autoeight V2

Single source of truth: AGENTS.md. Read it first; do not duplicate content here.

Essentials (full detail in AGENTS.md):

- Static HTML/CSS/JS, no framework, no build step, Cloudflare Pages at autoeight.ai.
- DEPLOYMENT CONTRACT: no build, folder path = live URL (edge 301s via _redirects; avoid URL churn).
  Never move or rename HTML pages or shared assets (style.css, main.js,
  includes.js, ae-track.js, ae-consent.js, nav.html, footer.html). Update
  sitemap.xml when adding/removing/renaming pages.
- services/ has 9 real files: ai-automation, crm-integration, data-reporting,
  email-automation, internal-systems, lms, sales-automation, sales-marketing,
  web-design. system-integration.html does NOT exist.
- backend/ = legacy redirect stubs to /admin/* — do not delete or rename.
- Code style: semantic HTML (one H1), 2-space indent, existing CSS custom
  properties, hyphenated class names, vanilla DOM JS, reuse existing components.
- British English. External links target="_blank" rel="noopener".
- Brand voice: direct, human, not corporate. Banned: comprehensive, streamlined,
  leveraging, robust, holistic, empower, bespoke, cutting-edge, seamlessly.
- SEO block required on every public page (see AGENTS.md). Never commit secrets.
